    "pass_rule_note": "Launched as a 48-question pool across 5 topics (12 schonzeiten_bayern, 9 fanggeraete_bayern, 10 fischereischein_bayern, 9 fischkunde_bayern, 8 gewaesserschutz_bayern), sized as a full exam-prep pool for the Bavarian Fischerprüfung, mirroring the real exam's ~60-question/5-subject-area structure (Art. 48 Abs. 1 BayFiG) at a smaller pilot scale. Exam Simulation/Training should draw questions per topic roughly proportionally, with a lower max-error tolerance and auto-fail on 2+ wrong high_stakes questions given the safety- and legal-compliance-critical nature of Schonzeit/Mindestmaß and gear-prohibition content, matching the DN-54-style pattern already used for kyc_aml/kartellrecht/lksg/sportboot modules. See app/app.js's EXAM_QUESTION_COUNT_BY_TYPE / MAX_ERROR_POINTS_BY_TYPE / EXAM_TIME_LIMIT_MS_BY_TYPE / EXAM_TOPIC_DRAW for wiring (to be done separately, out of scope for this content-only module).",
